{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_046D90","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"听说UFO还和Cattle Mutilation有关。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":41,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"<R=家畜,CATTLE>的<R=突然变异,MUTATION>？","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=家畜,CATTLE>\", \"<R=突然变异,MUTATION>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":48,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"不是Mutation，是Mutilation。……不过是英语，我也不知道什么意思。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":87,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"每次有人目击UFO，附近总会发生牛之类的家畜离奇死亡。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":75,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"听说那些尸体被抽干了血，眼珠和生殖器也被挖了出来。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":75,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"尸体有伤口又被放着不管，血当然会渗进地里。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":63,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"可听说那些伤口不像是地球上的刀具切出来的。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":63,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"不是被蛆之类啃的吗？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":30,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"还有说法称检测出了放射性。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":39,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"放射性……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":18,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"而且，我们待过的镇上也发生过山羊离奇死亡的事。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":69,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"还有人说目击了怪物。外形像<R=爬行动物,REPTILE>站起来一样，从头到背都长满了刺。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=爬行动物,REPTILE>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":111,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":12,"cn_text":"那也许就是外星人的真面目，或者是<R=外星人带来的怪物,ALIEN ANIMAL>……。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=外星人带来的怪物,ALIEN ANIMAL>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":98,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":13,"cn_text":"……不管怎样，都不像先进文明的形象。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":54,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":14,"cn_text":"要是在基地见到它，替我问个好。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":45,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":15,"cn_text":"如果语言能通的话。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":27,"review_flag":""}]}